        {
          "text": "kur iryebere piny i nyimgi, kur iworgi; pien an a Rwot Obaŋani, an Obaŋa ame nyek; aketo can i kom ikwae a jo ame daga pi bal a kwarogi naka tuno i kom lwagi me adek kede me aŋwen i kom ikwaegi, ",
          "type": "text",
