              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.18+HEB.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eb. 12.18-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kare a doŋ jo oneno piny obedo momora kede memenya atata, opel tye akoko, dok yito daŋ owumo kom kidi oko ipuk, lworo omakogi atek, komgi daŋ te bedo myel amyela. Jo te cuŋ i teŋe kannabor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ote kobbi Muca ni, “Yin en ikob kedwa, wan obino winyo; ento kur imi Obaŋa en a kob kedwa; bino miyo wan oto oko,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muca te kobbi jo ni, “Kur ilworu pien Obaŋa obino me temo cunywu, me ibed wunu i lworo i kome, wek kur ibal wunu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
